  "body": "1. Check if javascript URLs can be used as a base URL for relative URLs.\n2. If that is not possible, change the URL parser.\n3. If that is possible, change the HTML standard to still extract all the right bits in such a scenario. Perhaps by serializing and then chopping of the scheme.\n",
